{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115041017070-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115084414\"/><p>遇襲男子送院救治。</p><p>有「人間妖域」之稱的中環蘭桂坊發生傷人案。今日(15日)凌晨3時44分，一名22歲印度裔男子在蘭桂坊，與2名非華裔男子疑因碰撞問題爭執，期間被對方以硬物襲擊，面部遭割傷。對方逞兇後逃去，事主友人協助報案。事主清醒由救護車送往瑪麗醫院治理。警員到場調查，案件列「傷人」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:52:51.949875+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:10:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:36.359331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T00:46:22.589865+00:00","content_hash":"c99621ac7d975917accf762cd16b286362d4b13a113e0357c9896bcda2791b48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}